00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:40,366
The boundary holds. A checked copy
defends the 8-byte buffer.

2
00:00:40,366 --> 00:01:12,566
Same numbers. Opposite outcomes:
safe model exit 0, real bug exit 1.

3
00:01:12,566 --> 00:01:51,566
strcpy has no size check.
15 plus null is 16 into 8.

4
00:01:51,566 --> 00:02:33,899
Check then copy. n is min(size, 7).
Truncated safely, cut by plan.

5
00:02:33,899 --> 00:03:13,765
Eight cells. Nothing past 07.
A to G kept, H to O blocked.

6
00:03:13,765 --> 00:04:06,498
Same input. Opposite outcome.
Red abort exit 1, green exit 0.

7
00:04:06,498 --> 00:04:48,498
Safe code first, layers behind it.
Input length is not capacity.
